```

Shared patterns: provider + deep-link routes (`/admin/*`), command-palette entries, CSS reuse from `.settings-modal*`.

### Schema

**`users` additions**

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|--------|
| `password_hash` | text, nullable | Admin reset + future login; store scrypt/argon2id hash only |
| `deactivated_at` | timestamptz, nullable | Null = active; set = deactivated |
| `failed_login_count` | integer, not null, default 0 | For future lockout; writable by auth later |
| `locked_at` | timestamptz, nullable | Set when failure threshold hit (future writer) |

No `role` / `is_admin` column in this task (sole user is admin by convention).

**`api_keys` (new)**

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|--------|
| `id` | serial PK | |
| `user_id` | FK → users.id ON DELETE CASCADE | Owner |
| `name` | text | Label |
| `prefix` | text | Public prefix for display (`taskmesh_ro_` / `taskmesh_rw_` + short id) |
| `key_hash` | text | Hash of secret; never return raw after create |
| `access` | `readonly` \| `readwrite` | |
| `status` | `active` \| `suspended` \| `expired` \| `revoked` | |
| `expires_at` | timestamptz | Default create+60d when created |
| `last_used_at` | timestamptz, nullable | |
| `created_at` / `updated_at` | timestamptz | |
| `suspended_at` / `revoked_at` | timestamptz, nullable | |

**`system_properties` (new)** — key/value (or typed columns). Prefer a small keyed table:

| key | value (jsonb) | defaults |
|-----|---------------|----------|
| `api_rate_limit_per_minute` | number | e.g. 60 |
| `login_failure_threshold` | number | e.g. 5 |

Seed defaults on migrate / first read.

**`api_request_logs` (new)** — append-only usage/audit store for APIs + Logging tabs:

| Column | Notes |
|--------|--------|
| `id`, `created_at` | |
| `outcome` | `success` \| `api_failure` \| `auth_failure` \| `access_violation` |
| `method`, `path` | Request target |
| `status_code` | HTTP status |
| `ip` | Remote address when available |
| `user_id` | Nullable |
| `api_key_id` | Nullable |
| `message` | Short success/error summary |
| `admin_key` | boolean — true when owner is the sole admin user (audit flag for later) |

Lightweight Express middleware records rows for `/api/v1/*` (skip health/static). Until keys/auth exist, most rows will be unauthenticated browser traffic — still useful for graphs and Logging.

### API (admin-oriented; no role gate yet)

**Users**

- `GET /api/v1/admin/users` — list (id, referenceId, displayName, email, deactivatedAt, lastLoginAt, lastApiAt, lockedAt)
- `POST /api/v1/admin/users/:id/reset-password` — `{ password }` with shared password rules (min 12, upper/lower/digit/symbol); sets `password_hash`
- `POST /api/v1/admin/users/:id/deactivate` — confirm-required on client; sets `deactivated_at`; bulk-set that user’s keys to `revoked` (or `suspended` — prefer **revoked** for deactivate) and bump `updated_at`
- `POST /api/v1/admin/users/:id/reactivate` — clears `deactivated_at` (keys stay revoked; admin re-issues later)

**Keys**

- `GET /api/v1/admin/api-keys` — all keys, all statuses (never `key_hash`; show prefix, access, status, owner ref, dates)
- `POST /api/v1/admin/api-keys` — optional bridge create (name, access, expiresAt); return **one-time** raw key
- `POST /api/v1/admin/api-keys/:id/suspend` | `unsuspend` | `expire` (force expired) | `revoke`

**System properties**

- `GET /api/v1/admin/system-properties`
- `PATCH /api/v1/admin/system-properties` — partial update with Zod bounds (positive ints, sensible max)

**APIs / Logging**

- `GET /api/v1/admin/api-usage/summary?range=1h|1d|1w` — bucketed series for the four outcome classes
- `GET /api/v1/admin/api-logs?…` — paginated/filterable log list (outcome, path contains, since/until)

**Backups** — existing `/api/v1/backups*`; UI only moves.

