|---------|----------|
| **Users** | Table of users; actions: Reset password (modal + confirm), Deactivate / Reactivate (confirm). Show deactivated badge. |
| **Keys** | Table of all keys; status chips; Suspend / Unsuspend / Expire / Revoke with confirm. Optional “Create key” for bridge testing (one-time copy). |
| **APIs** | Chart(s) + range toggle (1h / 1d / 1w) for the four series. Empty-state when no logs. |
| **Logging** | Filterable table over `api_request_logs` (newest first). |
| **Backups** | Reuse `BackupsPage` inside Admin modal. |
| **System Properties** | Form for rate-limit + login-failure threshold; Save; show last-saved. Note in UI that enforcement is forthcoming. |

